   The planar f64 geometry types and algorithms in `space::r2` are a port of
   `geo`/`geo-types`: the geometry model, the predicates, the boolean sweep, the
   DE-9IM relate engine, and the measurement and transformation algorithms.

2. Interchange format specifications (implemented, not ported)
   The codecs in `format` are written from their published specifications rather
   than from any implementation: OGC/ISO Well-Known Binary and Well-Known Text,
   GeoJSON (RFC 7946), and the ESRI Shapefile technical description. No code was
   taken from PROJ, GEOS, or the `geojson`/`wkb`/`wkt` crates.
